<title>UK: Safeway adds cheap holidays to loyalty card.</title>
<headline>Safeway adds cheap holidays to loyalty card.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British food supermarkets operator Safeway Plc said on Wednesday it was adding cut-price package holidays from January 6 to the incentives on offer under its ABC loyalty card scheme.</p>
<p>It said shoppers would be able to use their ABC incentive points to get discounts on a range of holidays, which could be booked through a dedicated ABC Holiday Line telephone booking service run for Safeway by travel agent Page &amp; Moy.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
